{"id":"n18006-1-7","stage":5,"title":"고스란히 · 原封不动地","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18006-1-7-1","ko":"잃어버렸던 지갑 안에 들어 있던 돈은 다 잃어버린 거야?","zh":"丢失的钱包里的钱不都是丢了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잃어버렸던","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버렸던","audio":"/audio/78c4d066ba39e0931fe5.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}},{"text":"안에","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안에","audio":"/audio/3b4a5d602e7fd07a5b8d.mp3"}},{"text":"들어","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어","audio":"/audio/079c88dfcd6e6363232f.mp3"}},{"text":"있던","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던","audio":"/audio/abc85abdfa55b1e0bc82.mp3"}},{"text":"돈은","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈은","audio":"/audio/efd79924e71a2c4ed877.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어버린","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失；完","explanation":"잃다：丢，丢失，遗失；버리다：完；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"},{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버린","audio":"/audio/870c0d8437bddb80f7e4.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"原本拥有的东西在不知不觉间消失而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/290c524c37ce5170e1aa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18006-1-7-2","ko":"다행히 현금이 고스란히 남아 있었어.","zh":"幸好现金还完好无损地留在里面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다행히","meaning":"幸运，万幸，走运","explanation":"다행히：幸运，万幸，走运","readings":[{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23910","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}},{"text":"현금이","meaning":"现金，现款，现钞，现钱","explanation":"현금：现金，现款，现钞，现钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"현금","audio":"/audio/95b487c612772338b1f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73071","senseId":"2","lemma":"현금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"현금이","audio":"/audio/5427071d8b0255953781.mp3"}},{"text":"고스란히","meaning":"原封不动地，完整地","explanation":"고스란히：原封不动地，完整地","readings":[{"term":"고스란히","audio":"/audio/846925c642a6b8bdc9dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18006","senseId":"1","lemma":"고스란히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고스란히","audio":"/audio/846925c642a6b8bdc9dc.mp3"}},{"text":"남아","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아","audio":"/audio/6ab4b405a40e3c3ced24.mp3"}},{"text":"있었어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었어","audio":"/audio/7f1221d9d5431e3ca85b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7b75f0048465d767","term":"다행히","zh":"幸运，万幸，走运","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3","entryId":"23910","definition":"意外地运气好地。","pronunciation":["다행히"]},{"id":"95b487c612772338","term":"현금","zh":"现金，现款，现钞，现钱","audio":"/audio/95b487c612772338b1f3.mp3","entryId":"73071","definition":"当下持有的钱。","pronunciation":["현ː금"]},{"id":"846925c642a6b8bd","term":"고스란히","zh":"原封不动地，完整地","audio":"/audio/846925c642a6b8bdc9dc.mp3","entryId":"18006","definition":"一点都不减少或改变，以原来的状态。","pronunciation":["고스란히"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fb049316eece612d9fe1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.576,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18006","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/lic